**Investigating update behavior**

It seems I need to consider if `didUpdate` uses `postframe`. I'm questioning whether calling `_handleControllerChanged` with `setState` during `persistentCallbacks` could cause issues if invoked during disposal. It didn't trigger an assertion, but I wonder if `setState` at the finalize tree stage might influence a dirty state in a locked tree. I didn't see that happen before, but maybe it will after a fix. I'll rerun the format and analysis to test this!
